ffers ARGO high throughput (HT) System, a fully automated precision proteomics platform, performs ultra-high sensitivity and multiplexed analysis to support biomarker analysis across the continuum of discovery, translational research and ultimately, and diagnostics. The company's offering is utilized in research areas including immunology, neurology, and oncology. It serves global research and academic institutions, biopharmaceutical companies, contract research organizations, and service labs. The company operates in the United States, rest of Europe, Middle East and Africa, Germany, Asia Pacific, and internationally. It has a strategic partnership with Alzheimer's Disease Data Initiative, and Gates Ventures to advance translational research in alzheimer's disease. The company was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Fremont, California.","ceo_bio":"Dr. Yuling  Luo Ph.D. | Co-Founder, Chairman & CEO | Age 61 | Compensation: $662,065 (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 308 people. Revenue per employee of $241K ranks in the below the sector median among Healthcare peers. Stock-based compensation of $9K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). R&D investment of 50% of revenue (heavy) signals commitment to product development and talent.","financial_summary":["Alamar Biosciences, Inc. is a small-cap healthcare business with a $1.9B market cap on $74M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +195% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Gross margins of 45% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The company is burning through $60M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at +17.0% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, thin -78.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 0.1% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 22% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Accruals elevated at +17.0% of assets \u2014 Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Beneish M-Score flags potential earnings manipulation \u2014 a question of whether the reported numbers can be trusted","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"SGA costs surged 88% YoY \u2014 may reflect legal, restructuring, or operational issues","sev":"red","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Operating margins 43% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.2% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (99% sell ratio, net $40.6M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 345% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Healthcare peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 15% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Alamar Biosciences (ALMR) Stock May Look Fully Valued Following Raised 2026 Guidance","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-almr/alamar-biosciences/news/alamar-biosciences-almr-stock-may-look-fully-valued-followin","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793881807.849,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.904,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["guidance"]},{"title":"Alamar Biosciences (ALMR) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/alamar-biosciences-almr-q3-2026-163231000.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793811191.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"What Is Driving Attention To Alamar Biosciences (ALMR) Today?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-almr/alamar-biosciences/news/what-is-driving-attention-to-alamar-biosciences-almr-today","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793774346.761,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.71,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Alamar Biosciences Inc (ALMR) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Revenue Jumps 68% as Guidance ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/healthcare/articles/alamar-biosciences-inc-almr-q3-051057331.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793769057.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.402,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"Alamar signals $121M-$123M 2026 revenue while planning ARGO HT/DX FDA submission by end of next year (